<title>JAPAN: Ricoh - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ricoh - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		336.75		vs	  310.73</p>
<p> Operating	   20.55		vs	   11.58</p>
<p> Current	     17.85		vs	   14.27</p>
<p> Net		    9.07		vs	    7.99</p>
<p> EPS		   13.86 yen	  vs	   12.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    655 million	  vs	 652 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 1.00 yen	  vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - Ricoh Co Ltd is a leading maker of copiers.</p>
</text>
